{"title":"Ogre Shaman","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 44 Ogre that attacks with crush (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 21 times (1.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>233</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>222</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>189</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>238</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>233</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>222</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>189</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>238</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre-shaman\" data-map-level=\"46\">Show level 46 on the map</button>\n      \n  